  m_Name: lore_l5_last
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: RootAccess.Systems::RootAccess.Systems.LoreDefinition
  loreId: lore_l5_last
  title: Ultimul mesaj al lui L. Varga
  body: "Dac\u0103 ai ajuns la mainframe, termin\u0103 ce am \xEEnceput eu. Nu vinde
    datele, nu le \u0219terge. D\u0103-le \xEEnapoi oamenilor c\u0103rora le apar\u021Bin.
    \u0218i, te rog, schimb\u0103 cheia de sincronizare. Mi-e ru\u0219ine de ea."
  titleEn: L. Varga's last message
  bodyEn: If you made it to the mainframe, finish what I started. Don't sell the
    data, don't delete it. Give it back to the people it belongs to. And please,
    change the sync key. I'm ashamed of it.
  levelId: level05
  order: 14
